{"id":"1965e2b0765554c9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-tm.md","title":"Deterministic Turing Machine","display":"df-tm — Deterministic Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-tm","aliases":["28-df-tm"],"display":"df-tm — Deterministic Turing Machine","type":"definition","depends_on":[],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"11–13,79","source_pdf_pages":"37–39,105"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm — Deterministic Turing Machine"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"11–13,79"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"37–39,105"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\)</span> 为候选七元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup=2,\\ \\lhd=3,\\ \\rhd=4\">\\(\\sqcup=2,\\ \\lhd=3,\\ \\rhd=4\\)</span> 是固定符号码。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span> 表示工作带数；第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 带只读，第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\ldots,k\">\\(1,\\ldots,k\\)</span> 带可读写；工作带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 兼作输出。各带位置属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,0,1\">\\(-1,0,1\\)</span> 是移动指令。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\\delta\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\delta\\)</span> 为函数或关系映射的定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_M\">\\(k_M\\)</span> 将由其元数确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\mid{}&amp;Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |Q|,|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{0,1,\\sqcup,\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land |\\{q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\},\\\\\nK_M\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\mid\\operatorname{dom}\\delta=(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\\},\\\\k_M\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\begin{cases}\\min K_M&amp;K_M\\ne\\varnothing\\\\0&amp;K_M=\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\mid{}&amp;Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |Q|,|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{0,1,\\sqcup,\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land |\\{q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\},\\\\\nK_M\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\mid\\operatorname{dom}\\delta=(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\\},\\\\k_M\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\begin{cases}\\min K_M&amp;K_M\\ne\\varnothing\\\\0&amp;K_M=\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>七元组保留旧接口，改用原书的多带转移元数；有限状态和字母使用自然数编码，所以机器总体是集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Gamma|\\ge5\">\\(|\\Gamma|\\ge5\\)</span> 且非停机状态非空，转移域的元数唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_M\">\\(k_M\\)</span>。接受/拒绝两个停机状态代替原书一个停机状态及输出位。\n输入右端标记及有界输入头在配置中规定，是适用于小空间的标准变体；输出带计入工作空间。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.2，印刷 pp.11–13 / PDF pp.37–39；空间约定 §4.1，印刷 p.79 / PDF p.105。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqcup=2,\\ \\lhd=3,\\ \\rhd=4","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1,\\ldots,k","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"-1,0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"k_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\mid{}&Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |Q|,|\\Gamma|<\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\{0,1,\\sqcup,\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\\\\\n&\\land |\\{q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\},\\\\\nK_M\\coloneqq{}&\\{k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\mid\\operatorname{dom}\\delta=(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^{k+1}\\},\\\\k_M\\coloneqq{}&\\begin{cases}\\min K_M&K_M\\ne\\varnothing\\\\0&K_M=\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"|\\Gamma|\\ge5","display":false},{"tex":"k_M","display":false}],"bytes":2223,"backlinks":[{"id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，工作带数 $k=k_M$，see [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]。\n$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，有限输入字串写成 $x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}$；$T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)$，$\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)$。$I_x$ 为只读输入内容，$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$ 为固定输入的配置集。"},{"id":"c7bfa0375f35877e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fc596ec4c1021296","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$；$S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$G_\\ell$ 表示 $G$ 对 $\\Sigma^\\ell$ 的限制。\n$\\mathrm{TM}$、机器输出 $M(z)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_M(z)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；$\\operatorname{Fool}_m$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。"},{"id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的机器集。"},{"id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的机器集。"},{"id":"01678cd990532be9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a161e3a91eb15602","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 且 $G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；图的端口、乘数和邻点接口见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(x)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$1^N$ 是长度 $N$ 的一元输入。对 $q\\in\\mathbb N$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}(q)$；对 $b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)$。字串下标从1开始，$\\langle0\\rangle$ 是单比特零字串，$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$。$\\frown$ 表示字串串接，$\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N$ 按 $u$ 优先的字典序串接。$b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorname{Explicit},\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}$ 由下式引入。"},{"id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"89e240fe2a8a5b0c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的确定型机器集。"},{"id":"4c85902878b27217","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 是 [[28-df-tm]] 的机器集。"},{"id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})$ 是有限描述的候选机器；采用 [[28-df-tm]] 的只读二进制输入带、固定有限条半无限工作带和端标记约定。"},{"id":"91b637dbdbd7a2c3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(x)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$\\uparrow\\notin\\Sigma^*$ 是发散标记。"},{"id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b1af4753e8e3740a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 按 [[28-df-tm]] 与 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 在配对输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上运行，输出记作 $M(x;r)$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。"},{"id":"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}$；$Y_f,N_f$ 见 [[28-df-promise-problem]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(u)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(u)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布，随机带在证明固定后独立抽样。单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。"},{"id":"8330fa9041fa77ae","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$I_x$、$\\operatorname{Step}$ 分别见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。"},{"id":"e21780e838b68217","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。"},{"id":"9470641051e0a7af","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af1247ecca733ff0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的机器集。"},{"id":"070fdf0798352e03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的确定型机器集。"},{"id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的机器集。"},{"id":"e7acf5d437592730","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb0c882121f853e4","anchor":"ref-4","